<title>ARGENTINA: RESEARCH ALERT- Argentina's Bansud started as Buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Argentina's Bansud started as Buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Santander Investment said Friday it has initiated coverage of Argentine bank Bansud as &quot;Buy&quot;.</p>
<p>- Santander expects Bansud to report earnings per share of $0.92 in fiscal 1997 and $1.22 in fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
